Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.44,Black,Credits,0,0,0,,Tradução: Vacalos e Mangas\NLegendas: Vacalos e Mangas / KevinVG207\N-Proibida a distribuição das legendas junto ao vídeo-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:16.60,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Eu vou me tornar a melhor Uma Musume\Nque apreciadora de comida no Japão!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:21.21,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Gostoso! Isto não é nada mal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:28.57,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Posso repetir, por favor~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.38,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.43,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Kris S-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:42.27,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Você queria comer isto aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:47.07,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Se você não tiver problemas com sobras você pode ter isto aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.46,Black,Special Week,0,0,0,,Bom, até mais...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:58.19,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Bem levinho, com limão, mel duplo♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:02.56,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Ugyaaaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.54,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Splash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.37,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,K-Kris S-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:10.05,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,D-d-d-desculpa!! Vou limpar agora mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:13.39,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Não está aqui! Nem aqui! Não acho!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:15.07,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.14,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Deixa que eu limpo para você!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:19.18,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpa, desculpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:19.27,Black,Matikanetannhauser,0,0,0,,{\clip(676,993.33,1385.33,1056)}Ah, desculpa, desculpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:24.98,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,O-o-o que eu faço?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:31.14,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,Frio? Quente? Doce?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:33.36,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,{\t(868,1243,1,\c&HA0A0A0&)}Ou talvez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:38.79,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,E-e se uma fila grande se formou atrás de mim por eu estar demorando tanto...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:43.41,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,K-K-K-Kris S-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.05,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,Desculpa, desculpa, desculpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.05,0:01:51.17,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,Eu vou arrumar a máquina!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.88,Black,Meisho Doto,0,0,0,,Pelo menos aceite isto, por favor!
